              "page": 65,
              "label": "Constructive Alternatives",
              "text": "His vision included village republics , Khadi , basic education , and ethical living , offering a model of sustainable development. Gandhi's Hind Swaraj remains a foundational critique of modernity , advocating a life of simplicity, ethical self-rule, and harmony with nature and community.",
